      "message": "It actually call it twice. which is expected.\n\nBut what if it call it more after we checked the first expected two, nothing.\n\nI could call verifyNoMoreInteractions but it will be a pain to do such thing on Context since it is globally used.\n\nI could add again the verify in the teardown with a counter that must check it  has been call the correct amount of time.\n\nBut I think this is too much for this usecase",
